Features of Traneit Speed VPN

# Borderless, versatile
+ Complete VPN service, forever;
+ No registration required to use VPN;
+ Unlimited data transfer;
+ Compatible with all common connection types :wi-fi, 4g, lte, 3c and edge

# Protect your privacy
+ Save insecure wi-fi connections;
+ Provide private access to websites and applications;
+ Login is not required and does not require information query.

# Intuitive control and user friendliness
+ Easy to use, just touch connection.
+ Server is searching for maximum speed.
+ Steadily growing server pool around the world.

